WEBVTT

00:13:30.236 --> 00:13:31.996
Something's wrong.

00:13:32.796 --> 00:13:34.476
Something's different.

00:13:34.836 --> 00:13:36.676
You're not the same.

00:13:36.716 --> 00:13:38.116
I'm worried about you.

00:13:38.476 --> 00:13:39.876
Make statements.

00:13:40.556 --> 00:13:42.476
And it leaves very little room

00:13:42.476 --> 00:13:47.476
for somebody to divert the conversation.

00:13:50.196 --> 00:13:53.276
You're not the person I know.

00:13:55.076 --> 00:13:58.396
And do it with love and empathy
and the most important thing,

00:13:58.436 --> 00:14:00.396
don't show up to solve the problem.